WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.172
It is March.

2
00:00:09.173 --> 00:00:16.453
It is almost spring.

3
00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:22.730
Today I will grow an herb.

4
00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:33.977
The herb is rosemary.

5
00:00:33.978 --> 00:00:44.702
I push seeds in the dirt and cover them.

6
00:00:44.703 --> 00:00:48.512
I whisper to my tray every day.

7
00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:52.750
"Grow, Little Rosemary, grow!" I say.

8
00:00:52.751 --> 00:01:02.331
I run to Little Rosemary every day.

9
00:01:02.332 --> 00:01:09.816
I water Little Rosemary every day.

10
00:01:09.817 --> 00:01:15.094
She grows inside the dirt.

11
00:01:15.095 --> 00:01:21.035
I wait and wait.

12
00:01:21.036 --> 00:01:35.503
Then I see something green.

13
00:01:35.504 --> 00:01:41.066
I put her by the window.

14
00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:46.567
The sun shines.

15
00:01:46.568 --> 00:01:55.897
Little Rosemary grows more leaves.

16
00:01:55.898 --> 00:02:01.884
Little Rosemary smells good.

17
00:02:01.885 --> 00:02:06.197
Little Rosemary is tall.

18
00:02:06.198 --> 00:02:32.842
I plant her in the garden.

19
00:02:32.843 --> 00:02:35.767
I am glad Little Rosemary is here.

20
00:02:35.768 --> 00:02:43.767
I grew her by myself.

